      "prompt": "A school purchases $6$ workbooks at $48$ dollars each and $12$ lab packs at $47$ dollars each, then applies a voucher worth $24$ dollars. If the remaining balance is divided equally into $4$ monthly installments, what is the dollar amount of each installment?",
